{"title":"초보무사 일대기","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=qd5SE/hAFszT0zoQ/3y5Z7z5IsYFkNf6GWJV0Wk&filename=th3","synopsis":"마교와 싸우다 천라지망에 빠져 죽은 무림맹 집법단주 이군악!\n천하제일인에서 무공의 ‘ㅁ’자도 모르는 산골 나무꾼으로 다시 태어나다?!\n\n호화 영물과 영단으로 생초보 삼류무사에서 화경까지 오른 군악과\n때맞춰 다시 중원을 침공해온 마교!\n\n군악은 전생의 기억을 살려 십전십승의 대활약을 하지만,\n마교 교주의 아홉 제자를 만나 고전하게 되는데…\n‘악한 인간은 같은 방법으로 멸절시킨다’는 달마의 가르침은 이번 생에선 통할까?\n\n수백 년을 살아 이미 ‘마신’이 된 교주 독불군과의 마지막 전투.\n바보천치, 추한 쥐새끼로 불리던 나무꾼의 유쾌통쾌 대반란이 펼쳐진다!!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":71,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":72,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":68,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":61,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":65,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":69,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":70,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":74,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":76,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":79,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":84,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":88,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":85,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":79,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":79,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":82,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":77,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":75,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":81,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":80,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":76,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":81,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{